2. Authentication and Authorization: Use a secure authentication mechanism to ensure that only authorized users are able to access the application. This can be done using mechanisms like password-based authentication or two-factor authentication. Use role-based access control to ensure that users only have access to functions and data that they are authorized to access.
```javascript
